{"title":"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a quadrilateral with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/4/314bfa1fb251cfe31dbff4a462217c7e4ebce5b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=BC$\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c28b8d709d3b873ec6db017839b1520919db39db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/23386faeefe37629243fa264877b288499db5048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BCD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/290c0ed39e8b851ec3f2ccfee9c2e0f8b7d2f59f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC&gt;BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840cb55c82434b9ae047760636a017e9441e6ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4057c3e63298c2ed6715003afb6f2d9dc6272037.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDC$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />. These triangles share two of the same side lengths. Thus, by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hinge_Theorem\" title=\"Hinge Theorem\">Hinge Theorem</a>, since we are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e24db65783b06db5387d2575b7ecebae88a07226.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC    \\ge     \\angle BCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/290c0ed39e8b851ec3f2ccfee9c2e0f8b7d2f59f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC&gt;BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO\">1971 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017170730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1021/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1500/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.437      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box\n100.00%    7.437      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10524:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017170730 and revision id 112743. Rendering was triggered because: api